      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "•  One file:  docs/design/system.excalidraw\n•  You draw, you save, you tell me.  I read the file and answer.\n•  Everything I draw has an id starting with \"claude-\".  I never touch,\n   move or delete an element you made — yours are always safe.\n•  Delete anything of mine you disagree with.  That is the point.",
      "originalText": "•  One file:  docs/design/system.excalidraw\n•  You draw, you save, you tell me.  I read the file and answer.\n•  Everything I draw has an id starting with \"claude-\".  I never touch,\n   move or delete an element you made — yours are always safe.\n•  Delete anything of mine you disagree with.  That is the point.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "aq",
      "autoResize": true
    },
