      "updated": 1790191090513,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q1 \"where does the text come from\" — you added the\n   Body extractor. Done; what is left is card 7.\nQ2 \"does the kind route the extractor\" — now in\n   your caveats. Withdrawn.\nQ3 \"one output box, three outputs\" — answered by\n   two speeds. Note the third tier did not vanish:\n   the digest writer now does \"is it about him\"\n   (card 9).\nQ4 \"nothing loops back\" — your observability\n   caveat. Sharpened into card 11.\n\"Decider does two jobs\" — your board splits them:\n   Semantic dedup = which claim, Decider = post?\n   Keep that split. Withdrawn.",
      "originalText": "Q1 \"where does the text come from\" — you added the\n   Body extractor. Done; what is left is card 7.\nQ2 \"does the kind route the extractor\" — now in\n   your caveats. Withdrawn.\nQ3 \"one output box, three outputs\" — answered by\n   two speeds. Note the third tier did not vanish:\n   the digest writer now does \"is it about him\"\n   (card 9).\nQ4 \"nothing loops back\" — your observability\n   caveat. Sharpened into card 11.\n\"Decider does two jobs\" — your board splits them:\n   Semantic dedup = which claim, Decider = post?\n   Keep that split. Withdrawn.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
