    {
      "id": "claude-rev-1-b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2012,
      "y": 2300,
      "width": 382.79999999999995,
      "height": 225.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 541738469,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 725322761,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790191090513,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "JEV was tested on one article and eleven fixed kinds.\nHere it must read the new article PLUS 3–5 candidate\nclaims and say which one, or none. The options can be\nsent per call, so it is possible — but nothing measured\nsays it works. My old note \"needs a generative model\"\nis now wrong: Qwen already wrote the claim. Picking is\nenough.\n\nUnsaid: where does \"a result never joins a booking\"\nlive? I'd make it a FILTER on candidates by news_kind\nbefore any model call (measured: 0 crossover on 27).\n\nTest: replay the 300 in date order, join-or-start each,\nscore against the 136 rulings. ~$1 a pass. That IS the\nisolated test for this station.",
      "originalText": "JEV was tested on one article and eleven fixed kinds.\nHere it must read the new article PLUS 3–5 candidate\nclaims and say which one, or none. The options can be\nsent per call, so it is possible — but nothing measured\nsays it works. My old note \"needs a generative model\"\nis now wrong: Qwen already wrote the claim. Picking is\nenough.\n\nUnsaid: where does \"a result never joins a booking\"\nlive? I'd make it a FILTER on candidates by news_kind\nbefore any model call (measured: 0 crossover on 27).\n\nTest: replay the 300 in date order, join-or-start each,\nscore against the 136 rulings. ~$1 a pass. That IS the\nisolated test for this station.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
