    {
      "id": "claude-rev-3-b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3012,
      "y": 2300,
      "width": 375.84,
      "height": 210.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1960726531,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1609629137,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790191090513,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Entities: Article, Claim, Fighter. Nothing stores\n\"he fights X on date D\" or \"he last fought on D\".\nFour of your own rules need it:\n   • a result never joins a booking\n   • all predictions for one fight = one claim\n   • his own interviews in the post-fight window\n   • the digest's \"arc\" (booking → result → aftermath)\nYour \"story vs claim\" caveat describes exactly a bout.\nI'd not add a generic Story; add BOUT (fighter,\nopponent, event, date, status booked/done/cancelled),\nwritten by the extractor when kind = announcement or\nresult, and let a claim point to a bout optionally.\nThe other project built this from judged articles and\nit fixed their worst failure (lessons.md, RF).",
      "originalText": "Entities: Article, Claim, Fighter. Nothing stores\n\"he fights X on date D\" or \"he last fought on D\".\nFour of your own rules need it:\n   • a result never joins a booking\n   • all predictions for one fight = one claim\n   • his own interviews in the post-fight window\n   • the digest's \"arc\" (booking → result → aftermath)\nYour \"story vs claim\" caveat describes exactly a bout.\nI'd not add a generic Story; add BOUT (fighter,\nopponent, event, date, status booked/done/cancelled),\nwritten by the extractor when kind = announcement or\nresult, and let a claim point to a bout optionally.\nThe other project built this from judged articles and\nit fixed their worst failure (lessons.md, RF).",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
