      "seed": 2012401331,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 951552761,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790191090513,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "a) \"New\" is judged on the FIRST article. If a rumour\n   or analysis piece arrives first and the official\n   announcement joins it, the announcement is not new\n   → never posted. Make it \"first tier-1 article in\n   this claim\", not \"first article\".\nb) First article = first outlet. Often the foreign one,\n   the AMP copy, the content farm. Trade-off: post now,\n   or wait one run for a better source. Your rule\n   \"link the primary source\" needs a field the\n   extractor does not have yet: source artifact URL\n   (Instagram post, essay).\nc) Which kinds are tier 1? Board says announcement,\n   result. Your verdicts add his own post-fight\n   interviews (needs the bout date). JEV also has\n   injury and other_career_fact. Say the list.",
      "originalText": "a) \"New\" is judged on the FIRST article. If a rumour\n   or analysis piece arrives first and the official\n   announcement joins it, the announcement is not new\n   → never posted. Make it \"first tier-1 article in\n   this claim\", not \"first article\".\nb) First article = first outlet. Often the foreign one,\n   the AMP copy, the content farm. Trade-off: post now,\n   or wait one run for a better source. Your rule\n   \"link the primary source\" needs a field the\n   extractor does not have yet: source artifact URL\n   (Instagram post, essay).\nc) Which kinds are tier 1? Board says announcement,\n   result. Your verdicts add his own post-fight\n   interviews (needs the bout date). JEV also has\n   injury and other_career_fact. Say the list.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
