      "updated": 1790191090513,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Google News hands over a wrapper URL with no slug.\nThe real address appears only after decoding — which\nthe board puts inside the Body extractor, one station\nlater. So \"slugs compared stripped of domain\" cannot\nrun at station 2 for most items.\nToday production checks both identities (url and\nresolved_url). Options: decode in the URL dedup\nstation, or dedup twice (wrapper before, resolved\nafter). Also: the AMP edition slipped the sample's\ndedup (lessons.md) — slug-compare catches amp.host,\nnot /amp/ paths.",
      "originalText": "Google News hands over a wrapper URL with no slug.\nThe real address appears only after decoding — which\nthe board puts inside the Body extractor, one station\nlater. So \"slugs compared stripped of domain\" cannot\nrun at station 2 for most items.\nToday production checks both identities (url and\nresolved_url). Options: decode in the URL dedup\nstation, or dedup twice (wrapper before, resolved\nafter). Also: the AMP edition slipped the sample's\ndedup (lessons.md) — slug-compare catches amp.host,\nnot /amp/ paths.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
