      "locked": false,
      "text": "9 · DIGEST WRITER — no web search; the third tier moved here",
      "originalText": "9 · DIGEST WRITER — no web search; the third tier moved here",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "claude-rev-9-b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2012,
      "y": 3060,
      "width": 389.76,
      "height": 165.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 284525927,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 168702819,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790191090513,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Web search: push back. Nothing reaches the group\nwithout a row and a reason; a searched fact has neither.\nHigher-grade model: measure, don't guess — same week\nof ruled stories to Qwen and to a bigger model, compare\nthe digests by hand. Cents.\nUnsaid: \"one line per story\" makes the digest writer\nthe filter for empty mentions and side articles — the\nold bucket 3. Fine, but then its test is \"did it skip\nthe right stories\", not only \"is the prose good\".\nAlso: does it get the bout table? A week's digest\nwithout \"he fights X on the 14th\" reads odd.",
      "originalText": "Web search: push back. Nothing reaches the group\nwithout a row and a reason; a searched fact has neither.\nHigher-grade model: measure, don't guess — same week\nof ruled stories to Qwen and to a bigger model, compare\nthe digests by hand. Cents.\nUnsaid: \"one line per story\" makes the digest writer\nthe filter for empty mentions and side articles — the\nold bucket 3. Fine, but then its test is \"did it skip\nthe right stories\", not only \"is the prose good\".\nAlso: does it get the bout table? A week's digest\nwithout \"he fights X on the 14th\" reads odd.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
