      "text": "10 · WHAT HAPPENS WHEN A STATION FAILS?",
      "originalText": "10 · WHAT HAPPENS WHEN A STATION FAILS?",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "claude-rev-10-b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2512,
      "y": 3060,
      "width": 368.88,
      "height": 135.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1179260459,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1026728070,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790191090513,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Today every gate fails open and the article posts\nas it always did; only an unreachable DB is fatal.\nHere the claim row is the product, so falling open\nmakes a claimless article the group never sees again.\nQwen down → no extract → no dedup → ?\nJEV down → no kind → tier 1 impossible → ?\nI'd say: an article missing a stage result WAITS and\nis retried next run; nothing skips a station. That is\na change of philosophy — worth a line on the board.",
      "originalText": "Today every gate fails open and the article posts\nas it always did; only an unreachable DB is fatal.\nHere the claim row is the product, so falling open\nmakes a claimless article the group never sees again.\nQwen down → no extract → no dedup → ?\nJEV down → no kind → tier 1 impossible → ?\nI'd say: an article missing a stage result WAITS and\nis retried next run; nothing skips a station. That is\na change of philosophy — worth a line on the board.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
