      "text": "11 · TESTED IN ISOLATION — what each station's graded set is",
      "originalText": "11 · TESTED IN ISOLATION — what each station's graded set is",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "claude-rev-11-b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3012,
      "y": 3060,
      "width": 354.96,
      "height": 165.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 277002815,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 986204417,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790191090513,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Classifier    300 with Fable verdicts + 23 of yours\nExtractor     the ruled stories (fidelity by hand)\nSemantic dedup  136 rulings, replayed in date order\nDecider       docs/article-feedback.md (old rules)\nDigest writer nothing yet\nThree of five exist. The storyboard can produce the\nrest: the grader on measure-story-matching already\nshows stories and captures a verdict. Make ruling\n(\"right group / wrong group / wrong kind\") a button\nthere, and every future graded set writes itself.\nThat is your observability caveat, as a station.",
      "originalText": "Classifier    300 with Fable verdicts + 23 of yours\nExtractor     the ruled stories (fidelity by hand)\nSemantic dedup  136 rulings, replayed in date order\nDecider       docs/article-feedback.md (old rules)\nDigest writer nothing yet\nThree of five exist. The storyboard can produce the\nrest: the grader on measure-story-matching already\nshows stories and captures a verdict. Make ruling\n(\"right group / wrong group / wrong kind\") a button\nthere, and every future graded set writes itself.\nThat is your observability caveat, as a station.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
