      "updated": 1790191090513,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• The channel reads English; extracts are English.\n• Hourly cadence stays; \"immediately\" = within an hour.\n• One fighter per article. An article naming two\n  tracked fighters arrives twice from RSS and URL\n  dedup drops the second — so it is tied to one.\n• Kind list closed at four; JEV's has eleven.\n• Semantic dedup searches only the same fighter's\n  claims. Not drawn, probably intended.\n• A Tier-1 post links the article; a digest line\n  links the storyboard.\n• Per-fighter tuning in the decider (your dictation)\n  is not on the board.\n• Speaker rule \"only the coach\" is not on the board.",
      "originalText": "• The channel reads English; extracts are English.\n• Hourly cadence stays; \"immediately\" = within an hour.\n• One fighter per article. An article naming two\n  tracked fighters arrives twice from RSS and URL\n  dedup drops the second — so it is tied to one.\n• Kind list closed at four; JEV's has eleven.\n• Semantic dedup searches only the same fighter's\n  claims. Not drawn, probably intended.\n• A Tier-1 post links the article; a digest line\n  links the storyboard.\n• Per-fighter tuning in the decider (your dictation)\n  is not on the board.\n• Speaker rule \"only the coach\" is not on the board.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    }
  ],
